:ev08 a brv:CitationEvidence ;
    schema:description "Tosi & Pistolesi present 'La casa in via Pascoli' in Foligno (PG), 2006, designed by architect Baires Raffaelli, as a second example of accessible housing (115 sqm ground-floor flat with garden); Fig. 4.3 (floor plan) credits Arch. Baires Raffaelli, 2006; footnote 8 cites the Superabile article 'La casa in via Pascoli' as source."@en ;
