:ev09 a brv:CitationEvidence ;
    schema:description "Paper in the TFYD 2019 'Initiations' proceedings cites the Form book as ref. [2] (Introduction, translated by Silvia Antonini); a second copy of the book (file Initiations-FINAL-BOOK-optimized.pdf) shows the same reference at PDF p. 355."@en ;
