:ev10 a brv:CitationEvidence ;
    schema:description "Vilnius Academy of Arts master's thesis presents 'Pump it Up House' (inflatable emergency housing) as designed by Baires Raffaelli, Elio Rava, Paolo Moressoni and Tommaso Passalacqua; sources it to Europaconcorsi (2007), viewed 29 Nov 2012, project 24649. File 'download (4).pdf' is an identical copy."@en ;
