:ev11 a brv:CitationEvidence ;
    schema:description "ECORFAN book devotes section 2.8 (PDF p. 20) to The fast guide to architectural form, describing it as a visual guide presenting sixty forms; groups Raffaelli with Vyzoviti and Lim as recent experimental formal methodologies; reference at p. 91."@en ;
